.venv/
# Run artifacts: the JSON summaries ARE the dashboard's data source and must
# ship with the repo so a static deploy can render without re-running the
# experiment. The parquet evidence files are large and stay local; the
# manifest carries their digest, so the seal is still verifiable.
runs/**/*.parquet
runs/_batch.log
!runs/.gitkeep
.ipynb_checkpoints/
kaggle.json
chakra.egg-info/
*.egg-info/
data/raw/
